.97版本，经会议排查，任务运行时间是08:45，但建模内自定义sql算子依赖的数据表在doris产出的时间是08:52，所以任务运行时数据结果不全，可以把abi侧任务例行运行时间往后再调整一下，比如到9点，但如果下次上游任务产出时间晚于9点则又会出现类似情况，可以手动重跑任务绕行。\n</card>", "create_time": "2026-11-16 14:57", "deleted": false, "message_app_link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?openChatId=oc_7d6d8e8b7f10fb41d251a222b1a7af90&position=3610", "message_id": "om_x100b609edb3dfcacdf703ad1dc66709", "message_position": "3610", "msg_type": "interactive", "sender": {"id": "cli_a472c8e8c5f9d00d", "id_type": "app_id", "is_agent": false, "name": "火山引擎-售后智能助手", "open_bot_id": "ou_48cf9468e076e9838fcd93efbe775657", "sender_i18n_names": {"en_us": "BytePlus Support Bot", "zh_cn": "火山引擎-售后智能助手"}, "sender_type": "app", "tenant_key": "736588c9260f175d"}, "update_time": "2026-11-16 18:13", "updated": true}, {"chat_id": "oc_7d6d8e8b7f10fb41d251a222b1a7af90", "content": "@火山引擎-售后智能助手 透视表能否不展示空值/0的对应维度", "create_time": "2026-11-16 16:55", "deleted": false, "mentions": [{"id": "ou_48cf9468e076e9838fcd93efbe775657", "key": "@_user_1", "name": "火山引擎-售后智能助手"}], "message_app_link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?openChatId=oc_7d6d8e8b7f10fb41d251a222b1a7af90&position=3611", "message_id": "om_x100b60981e961ca0dfc8be72f5e4b97", "message_position": "3611", "msg_type": "text", "sender": {"id": "ou_9e11bda108a45a8f2631ebf2a0e5a531", "id_type": "open_id", "is_agent": false, "name": "赵秦雨", "sender_i18n_names": {"en_us": "Cherry"}, "sender_type": "user", "tenant_key": "2cdb9633accfd75d"}, "update_time": "2026-11-16 16:55", "updated": true}, {"chat_id": "oc_7d6d8e8b7f10fb41d251a222b1a7af90", "content": "<card title=\"问题进展【处理中】\">\n【问题描述】：\n\n透视表能否不展示空值/0的对应维度\n问题群聊已创建，可点击进群关注问题解决进展\n[点击进群](https://applink.larkoffice.com/client/chat/chatter/add_by_link?link_token=73dvc804-3b77-4530-ab95-e2bca23d536d)\n</card>", "create_time": "2026-11-16 16:55", "deleted": false, "message_app_link": "https://applink.feishu.cn/client/chat/open?openChatId=oc_7d6d8e8b7f10fb41d251a222b1a7af90&position=3612", "message_id